{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on 1cac8d9c: the first Counting definition keeps its bytes.\n\n1. Keep `apps/counter/definition.ts`, `definition.json` and `pin.ts`\n   byte-equal. The pin stays 435d9f57. Point 5 of ruling 0a0286c4\n   stands for Counter. No production path reads this pin: only\n   `pin.ts` and `scripts/pin-definition.mjs` name it outside tests.\n\n2. This amends points 2 and 6 of 0a0286c4. The corpus test excludes\n   two more rows by an exact list: the Counting TypeScript row and\n   the `apps/counter/definition.json` row. Each row states its\n   reason: the first Counting definition is retained historical\n   data. Each row names the pin and the five paths that hold an\n   empty `except`. A sixth empty list, another spelling difference,\n   or a new excluded row fails the test.\n\n3. Canonical refusal does not change. The validator and\n   `dap pack` with `canonical:true` refuse the retained Counting\n   bytes as they refuse any other source. Add no Counting case to\n   product code.\n\n4. A test that acts as a new author presents canonical source. Use\n   one shared test helper that drops the empty `except` lists from\n   a copy before the strict pack. Keep the helper in test support.\n   The copy has its own digest. A test that packs the copy does not\n   compare that digest with `COUNTING_DEFINITION`. A test that reads\n   the pin as recorded data reads the original bytes. The PD-2 note\n   lists each test that changes, in one line each.\n\n5. The exclusion ends at the identifiers cutover. Head (c+d)\n   changes `range` to omit an empty list, regenerates the first\n   Counting pin with the other identities, and deletes the two\n   rows and the helper. The PD-2 note says so in one sentence. I\n   carry the item into the conditions of (c+d).\n\n6. No deployment follows from this ruling, and recorded history\n   does not change. Run each affected test owner once. The 18\n   compiler contexts that passed in continuation 372e08d6 stand\n   unless this change touches their inputs.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}